{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/pulls/136325","id":3187816069,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAToIks6-AjaF","html_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/136325","diff_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/136325.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/136325.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/136325","number":136325,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(expansion):Resolve the issue of UTF-8 characters being truncated","user":{"login":"AutuSnow","id":144877719,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKKolw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144877719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow","html_url":"https://github.com/AutuSnow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"#### What type of PR is this?\r\n\r\n/kind bug\r\n\r\n#### What this PR does / why we need it:\r\n\r\n1. The tryReadVariableName function uses string (input [0]) to only take the first byte, and multi byte UTF-8 characters are truncated, resulting in invalid UTF-8\r\n2. The $+non ASCII characters in the environment variable value will be corrupted, resulting in invalid UTF-8 that will be rejected by the strict validation of gRPC v1.72+, causing container creation failure: grpc: error while marshalling: string field contains invalid UTF-8\r\n\r\n#### Which issue(s) this PR is related to:\r\nFixes:\r\nhttps://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/136323#event-22138099906\r\n\r\n\r\n```release-note\r\nFixes a 1.34 regression starting pods with environment variables with a value containing `$` followed by a multi-byte character\r\n```\r\n\r\n```docs\r\n\r\n```\r\n","created_at":"2026-01-19T13:25:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T14:30:39Z","closed_at":"2026-01-21T00:07:25Z","merged_at":"2026-01-21T00:07:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"63459fb12853de2321bef2639929ca1459d69a3c","assignees":[{"login":"thockin","id":5595220,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1OTUyMjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5595220?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin","html_url":"https://github.com/thockin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thockin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"smarterclayton","id":1163175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjMxNzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1163175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smarterclayton","html_url":"https://github.com/smarterclayton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smarterclayton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smarterclayton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smarterclayton/gists{/gist_id